WEBVTT

00:00:27.691 --> 00:00:30.093
I try to be softer.

00:00:30.127 --> 00:00:31.395
It's exhausting.

00:00:31.428 --> 00:00:32.930
(Laughter)

00:00:32.963 --> 00:00:37.167
The truth is, this tough shell
conceals sensitivities and insecurities

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.169
that only those closest to me know.

00:00:39.836 --> 00:00:42.673
And yeah, my masculine traits
make me the kind of gal

00:00:42.706 --> 00:00:44.474
that can hang with the guys,

00:00:44.508 --> 00:00:46.476
as long as I'm not their boss.

00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:48.712
Last winter, I was walking
through a ski resort

00:00:48.712 --> 00:00:50.681
and a man came up to me and said,

00:00:50.714 --> 00:00:54.985
"Excuse me, are you
with a husband or a fiancée?"

00:00:54.985 --> 00:00:58.355
"No," I said, and I continued
toward the lifts.

00:00:58.388 --> 00:01:00.324
And then curiosity got the better of me.